From 2d77f9918bbba7480627c8ebd18dc16a0697e7d2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Mar 2026 12:20:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] F-024: Rename SQL folders for AzerothCore auto-import

Rename data/sql/ subfolders to match AzerothCore db-assembler expectations:
- world -> db-world
- auth -> db-auth
- characters -> db-characters

This enables automatic SQL import without docker-compose volume changes.
The optional/sql/world/ folder is intentionally left unchanged to prevent
auto-import of optional content.

Reference: IPP Discord (Grimfeather, 2025-11-26)

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
